This bundle carries the Julia runtime (https://julialang.org/license, MIT) and the
libraries it ships, built by Julia's BinaryBuilder recipes (https://github.com/JuliaPackaging/Yggdrasil):

  libjulia, libjulia-internal, libopenlibm, libdSFMT, libuv, libblastrampoline   MIT or similar permissive licenses
  OpenBLAS                            BSD-3-Clause
  SuiteSparse (AMD, BTF, CAMD, CCOLAMD, COLAMD, KLU, LDL, SuiteSparse_config)   BSD-3-Clause or LGPL-2.1+
  SuiteSparse (CHOLMOD, SPQR, UMFPACK, RBio)                                      GPL-2.0+ or LGPL-2.1+
  GMP                                 LGPL-3.0+ or GPL-2.0+
  MPFR                                LGPL-3.0+
  PCRE2                               BSD-3-Clause
  zlib                                zlib License
  libunwind                           MIT
  libstdc++, libgcc_s, libatomic, libgomp, libssp, libgfortran, libquadmath
                                      GPL-3.0 with the GCC Runtime Library Exception

The corresponding source of the GPL and LGPL libraries, at the versions this runtime
ships, is attached to the same release as <name>-sources-gpl.tar.
